sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant GH as GitHub Actions
  participant AZ as Azure (OIDC)
  participant ACR as opentaxacr
  participant PG as opentax-pg
  participant W as opentax-web
  participant J as opentax-worker
  GH->>AZ: azure/login (federated, main only)
  GH->>ACR: buildx push opentax:sha
  GH->>PG: open firewall for runner IP
  alt migration drops or renames
    GH->>GH: wait for db-contract approval (Cody)
  end
  GH->>PG: pnpm db:migrate
  GH->>PG: close firewall (always)
  GH->>W: containerapp update image sha
  GH->>J: containerapp job update image sha
  GH->>W: GET /api/health x10
